# key|kind|label|platforms|default|choices
ZEDBSD_ROOTFS_DEVELOPMENT|bool|Install development files (/usr/include, .so links, .pc, .a)|*|y|
ZEDBSD_GRAPHICAL_BOOT|bool|Graphical boot: boot logo and graphical login (n for kernel development)|amd64|y|
ZEDBSD_BOOT_KERNEL_MESSAGES|bool|Show kernel messages on the screen at boot (n: dmesg only, kmsg=quiet)|amd64|n|
ZEDBSD_GRAPHICAL_LOGIN|bool|Graphical login: start Keiland automatically (login=graphical)|amd64|y|
ZEDBSD_NOCT_ACCEL|bool|Noct's GPU accelerator (OpenGL ES; needs libegl and libglesv2)|amd64|n|
